<<Video "images/characters/mom/events/morning wakeup/morning_coffee.webm" "" "" 600>>

The sun is coming through the blinds in stripes when the door opens. $mom.callName pads in barefoot with a steaming mug, still in what she slept in, a little white crop top and a pair of yellow panties, with her blonde hair loose and messy around her face. She sets the mug on the nightstand and gives my shoulder a gentle shake.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $mom, text: "Good morning, sleepyhead. I brought you a coffee, and it's still hot, so you have no excuse." },
{ text: "She catches me noticing what she's wearing and tugs at the hem of her top, which doesn't make it any longer." },
{ who: $mom, text: "Oh, don't look at me, I'm a disaster. I've been running around since before six and I haven't had a single minute to get dressed, and if I don't bring you this now, I swear it'll be lunchtime before I remember." },
{ who: $player, text: "You look fine, $mom.callName. Thanks for the coffee." },
{ who: $mom, text: "You're welcome, sweetie. Now drink it while it's hot and get yourself up, you've got a whole day waiting out there." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

She gives her top one more useless tug on the way out and leaves the door open a crack behind her, the way she always does, so I can't just roll over and go back to sleep.

<<Video "images/characters/mom/events/morning wakeup/drink_coffee.mp4" "" "" 600>>

I sit up and drink it slowly. By the time the mug is empty I'm more or less a person again.

